per trovare il percorso più adatto</h2></div></div></div></div><div id="div_block-299-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="code_block-928-19" class="ct-code-block"><iframe src="./terr1_files/comune-di-bottanuco_747087.html" style="z-index:99;border:0px #ffffff none;" name="myiFrame" scrolling="yes" frameborder="1" marginheight="0px" marginwidth="0px" height="100%" width="100%" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></div></div><div id="div_block-309-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="new_columns-310-19" class="ct-new-columns"><div id="div_block-311-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-313-19" class="ct-div-block"><h2 id="headline-314-19" class="ct-headline">Ecco come funziona, ti bastano pochi passi!</h2></div><div id="div_block-324-19" class="ct-div-block"><h2 id="headline-325-19" class="ct-headline"></h2></div></div></div><div id="div_block-379-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-381-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-382-19" class="ct-div-block "><h2 id="headline-414-19" class="ct-headline">Da Desktop<br></h2><div id="div_block-807-19" class="ct-div-block"><img id="image-804-19" alt="" src="./terr1_files/right.svg" class="ct-image"></div><div id="div_block-402-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-403-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-404-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-405-19" class="ct-headline">Seleziona il Percorso</h4><h2 id="headline-406-19" class="ct-headline">Consulta tutte le informazioni relative al percorso.</h2></div></div></div><div id="div_block-383-19" class="ct-div-block border-radius"><div id="div_block-787-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-788-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-789-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-790-19" class="ct-headline">Consulta la Mappa</h4><h2 id="headline-791-19" class="ct-headline">Nella mappa interattiva troverai il percorso, punti d’interesse e indicazioni sulle specie botaniche presenti.</h2></div></div></div><a id="div_block-796-19" class="ct-link border-radius" href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1P3WQhhZ5nDE92C1bTgWKtYlBOTHnOiuM&amp;hl=it&amp;usp=sharing"><div id="div_block-797-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-798-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-799-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-800-19" class="ct-headline">Apri la mappa con l’app</h4><h2 id="headline-801-19" class="ct-headline">Segui le indicazioni&nbsp;<br>per visualizzare il percorso&nbsp;<br>e la tua posizione&nbsp;<br>direttamente sull'app Maps del tuo smartphone</h2></div></div></a><div id="div_block-419-19" class="ct-div-block "><h2 id="headline-420-19" class="ct-headline">Da Mobile<br></h2><div id="div_block-421-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-422-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-423-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-424-19" class="ct-headline">Scansiona QRcode</h4><h2 id="headline-425-19" class="ct-headline">Scansiona il QRcode con la propria fotocamera per accedere al percorso e visualizzarne la mappa interattiva.</h2></div></div></div><div id="div_block-811-19" class="ct-div-block"><img id="image-812-19" alt="" src="./terr1_files/right.svg" class="ct-image"></div></div></div><div id="div_block-827-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-828-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-829-19" class="ct-div-block "><h2 id="headline-830-19" class="ct-headline">Da Desktop<br></h2><div id="div_block-831-19" class="ct-div-block"><img id="image-832-19" alt="" src="./terr1_files/right.svg" class="ct-image"></div><div id="div_block-833-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-834-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-835-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-836-19" class="ct-headline">Seleziona il Percorso</h4><h2 id="headline-837-19" class="ct-headline">Consulta tutte le informazioni relative al percorso.</h2></div></div></div><div id="div_block-850-19" class="ct-div-block "><h2 id="headline-851-19" class="ct-headline">Da Mobile<br></h2><div id="div_block-852-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-853-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-854-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-855-19" class="ct-headline">Scansiona QRcode</h4><h2 id="headline-856-19" class="ct-headline">Scansiona il QRcode con la propria fotocamera per accedere al percorso e visualizzarne la mappa interattiva.</h2></div></div></div><div id="div_block-860-19" class="ct-div-block"><img id="image-861-19" alt="" src="./terr1_files/ico-down.svg" class="ct-image"></div><div id="div_block-838-19" class="ct-div-block border-radius"><div id="div_block-839-19" class="ct-div-block"><div id="div_block-840-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-841-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-842-19" class="ct-headline">Consulta la Mappa</h4><h2 id="headline-843-19" class="ct-headline">Nella mappa interattiva troverai il percorso, punti d’interesse e indicazioni sulle specie botaniche presenti.</h2></div></div></div><div id="div_block-863-19" class="ct-div-block"><img id="image-864-19" alt="" src="./terr1_files/ico-down.svg" class="ct-image"></div><div id="div_block-844-19" class="ct-div-block border-radius"><a id="div_block-845-19" class="ct-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1P3WQhhZ5nDE92C1bTgWKtYlBOTHnOiuM&amp;ll=45.636573415226096%2C9.505763999999983&amp;z=15"><div id="div_block-846-19" class="ct-div-block"></div><div id="div_block-847-19" class="ct-div-block"><h4 id="headline-848-19" class="ct-headline">Apri mappa</h4><h2 id="headline-849-19" class="ct-headline">Segui le indicazioni per visualizzare il percorso e la tua posizione direttamente sull'app Maps del tuo smartphone</h2></div></a></div><div id="div_block-857-19" class="ct-div-block"><img id="image-858-19" alt="" src="./terr1_files/right.svg" class="ct-image"></div></div></div></div></div></section><div id="section-480-19" class=" ct-section" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden;"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap">
